			<div class="content" id="post-content-1886525">
									

<p>Simple and scary. +1</p>
<p>I wouldn't mind some more development along the lines of a possible &quot;memetic&quot; effect, but I prefer the beauty in simplicity as it is now.</p>
<p>Anyway</p>
<blockquote>
<p>&quot;However, Agent T█████ appeared to be viciously stabbing several other members of the Task Force&quot;.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>How can this be depicted on a single unmoving picture? Was he stabbing the MTF guys like a shishkebab? Because I can't imagine how a stabbing of several MTF members at the same time, moreso &quot;viciously&quot; could be recorded this way.</p>

