			<div class="content" id="post-content-1889312">
									

<p>I imagine it as a couple people appeared dead/severely injured from knife wounds, while the agent in question was in the process of stabbing someone else.</p>
<p>I actually wonder who opened the box. The agent shown killing everyone may have been the one, and their greatest fear was going crazy and killing all their dear friends on the MTF. *brainsplosion*</p>
<p>I see nothing wrong with the 682 reference, either. It's perfectly fitting in this context. Of all the scips, it's probably one of the more well-known by many of the people in the Foundation, and I could see being mauled by it during a containment breach as being someone's greatest fear, especially if the person assembling the puzzle was assigned to 682.</p>

